# 29_noise_sleep_pulsed.ledc — AM-Noise Sleep Bed (PULSED / trapezoid), ~30 min
# Technique: playbook A6 "AM-noise carrier", PULSED variant using the v2 trapezoid gate
#            (env=3). Pink noise is gated at 0.85 Hz with a 40% duty and a soft 50 ms
#            raised edge (attack) -> gentle, crisp-but-click-free bursts rather than the
#            smooth sine swell of 28_noise_sleep_bed.ledc. Same slow delta/sleep pulse rate.
# Bands: pink-noise trapezoid AM at 0.85 Hz (sleep-onset delta); brown-noise steady bed; light steady.
#
# Engine caveat: AM depth is fixed (~0.1) in this build, so even the trapezoid gate is a
#   gentle burst, not a deep on/off — deeper isochronic pulsing awaits the firmware depth work.
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of
#   photic migraine. Do not use while driving. Experiential, not medical.
#   Light STEADY (freq 0, no flicker), dim warm amber; brightness ramps in/out; noise fades
#   in 60 s and out at the end. The 50 ms trapezoid attack keeps every burst click-free.
#   A sleep bed — ends dark + silent, no wake-up.
#
# LED columns : time freq duty bright R G B mask
# Audio cols  : A time freq pan vol mod [ch] [freq_r] [wave] [duty] [env] [phase] [attack]
#               (env 3 = trapezoid gate; duty = on-fraction %; attack = edge ms)
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (the >/* prefix sits where a segment BEGINS).

# --- Settle (00:00-01:00): dim amber steady light + noise fade-in ---
0 0 100 >0 255 90 0 255                  # LED steady dim amber; brightness fade-in from 0
A 0 200 0 >0 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50        # ch1 pink noise, 0.85 Hz trapezoid gate (40% duty, 50 ms attack); vol fade-in
A 0 100 0 >0 0 2 0 6                     # ch2 brown noise, steady warm bed; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Settling in. Let the slow waves of sound rock you toward sleep."
15000 0 100 12 255 90 0 255              # brightness reaches 12% (dim; >=10 s ramp-in)
A 60000 200 0 45 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50    # ch1 pink vol settled 45 (trapezoid held)
A 60000 100 0 30 0 2 0 6                 # ch2 brown vol settled 30

# --- Hold (01:00-28:00 = 27 min): steady dim light + pulsed pink bed + brown warmth ---
S 600000 default 65 "Each soft pulse a little deeper. Nothing to hold. Just drift."

# --- Soft Off (28:00-30:00): brightness + both noise beds fade to 0 (no wake-up) ---
1680000 0 100 >12 255 90 0 255           # LED brightness ramp-out START 12 ...
A 1680000 200 0 *45 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50 # ch1 pink quad fade 45->0 (trapezoid held)
A 1680000 100 0 *30 0 2 0 6              # ch2 brown quad fade 30->0
S 1680000 default 65 "The pulses are fading now. Let go completely. Sleep."
1800000 0 100 0 255 90 0 255             # end: brightness 0 (dark)
A 1800000 200 0 0 0.85 1 0 5 40 3 0 50   # end: pink vol 0
A 1800000 100 0 0 0 2 0 6                # end: brown vol 0 (silent)
